The plate is a square side plate, roughly 20-22 cm across. In the image it spans about 350 px, so about 0.06 cm per px... that gives about 6 px per cm at ~20 cm... more precisely, 350 px / 21 cm ≈ 16.7 px per cm. The bagel is about 175 px wide, which is about 10.5 cm. That is a typical bagel half, perhaps a little small.

A bagel half weighs about 50-60 g, or around 140-150 kcal. The cream cheese spread is about 20 g, or around 70 kcal. Together that is about 75 g and about 215 kcal.

